# Force LF on every text file.
#
# Checks are run on Linux and the plugin source, locale JSON and workflow YAML
# are all reviewed as diffs; a Windows contributor whose editor writes CRLF
# would otherwise show every line of every file as changed, and the packed
# tarball would ship CRLF into a Linux-only runtime.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.tgz binary
